INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (332,433,'introduction','<h1 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"10710d4\" data-start=\"131\" data-end=\"162\">Cozumel International Airport</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"164\" data-end=\"472\">Cozumel International Airport is the main airport on the island of Cozumel and serves both commercial airlines and private aircraft. Please look for the General Aviation (GA) building/ FBO. Conveniently located just <strong data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"343\">3 km (1.9 miles)</strong> from downtown San Miguel, it provides quick access for travelers visiting Cozumel or continuing their journey by private flight.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"674\">Flights Holbox operates private charter flights from Cozumel International Airport to Holbox, offering one of the fastest and most comfortable ways to reach the island in approximately <strong data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"673\">30 minutes</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"679\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"c7ngg7\" data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"731\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Where Is Cozumel International Airport Located?</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"874\">Cozumel International Airport is located on the north side of San Miguel de Cozumel, approximately <strong data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"852\">3 km (1.9 miles)</strong> from the city center.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"1028\">Its convenient location allows most hotels, ferry terminals and downtown attractions to be reached within <strong data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1027\">10–15 minutes by taxi or private transfer</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1033\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14ooqw5\" data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1056\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Airport Facilities</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1299\">Cozumel International Airport features a single passenger terminal with two levels. While considerably smaller than Cancun International Airport, it provides all essential services for passengers travelling on commercial and private flights.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1320\">Facilities include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1459\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"d7tpdm\" data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1358\">Comfortable passenger waiting area</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"103vsgk\" data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1370\">Restrooms</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"15rxlnr\" data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1392\">Check-in facilities</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1pizj2n\" data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1421\">Small on-site parking area</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"ma1ceu\" data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1443\">Car rental services</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"15l3jcy\" data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1459\">Taxi services</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1473\">Please note:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1626\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"lb3grf\" data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1550\">The terminal does not have air conditioning throughout all waiting areas.</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"h68pmh\" data-start=\"1551\" data-end=\"1626\">We recommend wearing light clothing, especially during the warmer months.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1631\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bvnvr6\" data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1649\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Opening Hours</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1706\">The passenger terminal is generally open daily between:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1729\"><strong data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1729\">7:00 AM – 9:00 PM</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1843\">Private flights operate <strong data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1785\">during daylight hours only</strong>, as flight schedules depend on local daylight conditions.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1848\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"a7o2sb\" data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1899\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">How Do I Get to Cozumel International Airport?</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1937\">The airport is easily accessible by:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1977\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1j4cxzg\" data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1945\">Taxi</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"esfn2m\" data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1964\">Private transfer</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"xj254\" data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"1977\">Rental car</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2072\">Most visitors can reach the airport from downtown San Miguel in approximately <strong data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2071\">10 minutes</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2222\">Because public transportation is limited, we recommend arranging your transportation before your departure, particularly during busy travel periods.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2227\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"g4paon\" data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2270\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Private Flights from Cozumel to Holbox</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2374\">Flights Holbox operates private charter flights directly from Cozumel International General Aviation (GA).</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2562\">The flight takes approximately <strong data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2421\">30 minutes</strong>, allowing passengers to avoid lengthy ferry crossings and road transfers while enjoying a fast, comfortable and exclusive travel experience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2681\">Private flights are ideal for couples, families and small groups looking for the quickest way to reach Holbox Island.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"10nxbs1\" data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"575\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Airport Use Fee (TUA)</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"842\">Passengers departing on <strong data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"683\">domestic private charter flights from the Cozumel FBO (Fixed Base Operator)</strong> are required to pay an <strong data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"758\">Airport Use Fee (TUA) of around MXN $200 per passenger</strong>. This fee is <strong data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"788\">not included</strong> in the charter price and is payable before departure.</p>');
